{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"Download the SDK","anchor":"Download-the-SDK","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"text","code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── CardProvisioningExtension.xcframework","│   ├── CardSessions.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Required-Frameworks","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks"},{"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning-Sessions-Approach","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Network Token Provisioning (Sessions Approach)"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All of the following frameworks are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for the sessions-based provisioning:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Framework","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Purpose"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Import in Code?","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"CardProvisioningSessions.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineConten